  "description": "Freshly uniformed and ready for justice, rookie cop Jeong Taejun envisioned a thrilling life of high-stakes arrests and heroic fame. Reality, however, drops him in a peaceful countryside town where the biggest threat is stray livestock. Eager to prove himself, Taejun spots a suspicious figure crouching in a field and leaps at the chance to make his first big bust. He promptly handcuffs Yeon Jiwu, only to discover that he isn't a thief, but a local just tending to his own crops. Mortified by his blunder, Taejun tries to make amends, but spending time around the charming local might get his heart handcuffed for real.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
